thermonuclear.tooltip.component=Axis follows the placement face. Nuclear Power Plant D component: all 52 fuel rod blocks must match tiers. No crafting recipe, heat capacity bonus or fuel formula changes.
thermonuclear.tooltip.turbine_shaft=Axis follows the placement face. Large Steam Turbine G component: all 26 shafts must match tiers and lie along the turbine's length; low-pressure tier 1, high-pressure tier 2. No crafting recipe or tier performance bonus yet.
