thermonuclear.tooltip.prototype=Creative-test prototype; no crafting recipe. Config values are not final balance.
thermonuclear.tooltip.mod=Thermonuclear Expansion [thermonuclear]
thermonuclear.tooltip.no_maintenance=No maintenance hatch or failures. GT rotor wear remains enabled.
thermonuclear.tooltip.nuclear=Identical-rod batch limit = configured base x item pipe tier (default 256 x tier). Shortest lifetime first; direct generation requires a dynamo.
thermonuclear.tooltip.heat_exchange=Hot coolant + distilled water -> ordinary, superheated or supercritical steam + all cold coolant; hot super coolant doubles steam yield.
thermonuclear.tooltip.steam_turbine=GT rotor in controller; ordinary steam only. 160 L steam returns 1 L distilled water.
thermonuclear.structure.controller=Front centre, middle layer; offset (1,1,0)
thermonuclear.structure.box=3x3x3: 1 controller, 25 heat-proof casing positions, 1 internal air block. Each hatch replaces one casing, not an extra block.
thermonuclear.structure.hatches=Compatible GT IO hatches, including ME, DEBUG, dual input, multi-amp and wireless dynamos. No maintenance required.
thermonuclear.structure.nuclear.controller=Export position H, facing out of the annex front wall (export -Z); offset (2,20,7), not the scanner offset.
thermonuclear.structure.nuclear.blocks=D: 52 matching-tier Thermonuclear fuel rod blocks, tiers 1-4; F: reinforced concrete; G: 353 source water blocks (including former E positions).
thermonuclear.structure.nuclear.pipes=C: 14 matching-tier fluid pipe casings; bronze, steel, titanium, tungstensteel, PTFE, PBI are tiers 1-6. Tier controls fuel batch size. Channels: fluid_pipe_casing / fuel_rod.
thermonuclear.structure.nuclear.services=B: 50 concrete or item bus, dynamo, optional maintenance positions; compatible subclasses accepted, fluid and dual input hatches rejected.
thermonuclear.structure.nuclear.coolant_io=The two A positions require exactly one fluid input hatch and one fluid output hatch, with no casing substitute.
thermonuclear.structure.heat_exchange.box=9×14×7: controller faces outward; D is solid steel machine casing and E is bronze pipe casing.
thermonuclear.structure.heat_exchange.cold_input=A: cold-fluid input hatch; distilled water is read from this position.
thermonuclear.structure.heat_exchange.cold_output=B: cold-fluid output hatch; cooled fluid is sent to this position.
thermonuclear.structure.heat_exchange.hot_input=C: hot-fluid input hatch; hot coolant is read from this position.
thermonuclear.structure.heat_exchange.hot_output=F: hot-fluid output hatch; steam is sent to this position.
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.controller=Export H position, facing out of the side wall; rotated size 30x15x15, offset (2,13,0).
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.blocks=C: solid steel machine casing; D: steel gearbox casing; E: steel pipe casing; F: GT steel block. Spaces do not require air.
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.shafts=G: 26 matching shafts lying along the turbine's length, low-pressure tier 1 or high-pressure tier 2. Select via turbine_shaft construction channel; no tier performance bonus yet.
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.output=A: actual fluid output hatch for distilled water; no casing fallback. NEI preview shows an output hatch.
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.input=B: actual fluid input hatch for ordinary steam; no casing fallback. NEI preview shows an input hatch.
thermonuclear.structure.turbine.dynamo=C: replace solid steel casing with at least one dynamo; fluid hatches cannot replace C.
